    "fusionReviewHelp" : {
      "comment" : "App Fusion: Only the text below will be sent to the on-device model. Correct OCR errors or supply notes, up to 6,000 characters per source. Input stays in memory for up to 15 minutes. Compare and differences need text for both sources; a checklist can use one.",
